description	"Hidden Bek Scout

Agile swoop racers and scouts for the Hidden Beks. They rely on speed and surprise to navigate the Lower City of Taris, using their mobility to outmaneuver stronger opponents.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
-- 15% Faster Movement Speed
- Vibroknife 
-- 15% Faster Movement Speed
-- No Saber/Blaster Defense
-- No Deflect
-- Cripples on Hit, Low Damage

^8Attributes:
- Reinforcement (2)
- Dodge (2)
- Stamina (2)
- Grapple Hop (1)
- Aerial Resource Regen
- Tracking Beacon

^3Abilities:
- Sprint ^3[CS1]
- Dodge (2) ^3[CS2]"
